    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The tip-tappa-tip of the rain takes me to a different time... a different place.",
      "translation": "Ťukání deště ‚tip-ťap-tip‘ mě přenáší do jiné doby... na jiné místo.",
      "sourceSHA256": "72b4babae3c2410678531fd85d949700074f92672b50740c2e205d8466778953",
      "translationSHA256": "eff1d22c6b88e2e6307c4261a6f572d9f31a52775a6fb82d078ebd37af4c238d",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I guess... if I had some pants I might've gone outside today... but, nah.",
      "translation": "Asi... kdybych měl nějaké kalhoty, možná bych dnes vyšel ven... ale kašlu na to.",
      "sourceSHA256": "ae1e39bcebf613cc10fadfb178f2efd5f0497f3f1e9b1ffb095916e80b4e280d",
      "translationSHA256": "d0ba37a87a2ce972934fbea3ea7e527ecee95a96d291a5005b24d07478babc2d",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I like gloomy weather, but I feel kinda bad for the hens.",
      "translation": "Ponuré počasí mám rád, ale slepic je mi trochu líto.",
      "sourceSHA256": "a5f6cccf3586760dc75b31a2c944efdb217de5bd0ad0535baf71d556741ad754",
      "translationSHA256": "46f6b3ec27da9c99cd88d509382e6290f1b8ce0a20a095afeec72b69a0a36765",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Tip-tappa-tip-tappa-tip... I'm starting to feel thirsty.$6",
      "translation": "Tip-ťap-tip-ťap-tip... Začínám mít žízeň.$6",
      "sourceSHA256": "01e597848d82891eb532fc08d145c5818a5cbdf3502e94d95db8fe8c317ab609",
      "translationSHA256": "a2d81800a118fed125b1285cf60708a09caa1a18dd00177ed29c09af6fd78c0c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_0",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Buh... sometimes life feels like a slow, gray blur... know what I mean?",
      "translation": "Blé... Někdy mi život připadá jako pomalá šedá šmouha... víš, jak to myslím?",
      "sourceSHA256": "9b8b8aafea14a245ba9f2b46b4ea397e176124c9e4754f3f795c1a9217465678",
      "translationSHA256": "2a311356cf6683ddd1feb97a03def8b0ed041ecce955480b4c20053f716ec8d6",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey. Take this... I put a bit too much in the microwave. [195 215 206]#$e#Sorry if it's squishy.",
      "translation": "Hej. Vezmi si to... Dal jsem toho do mikrovlnky trochu moc. [195 215 206]#$e#Promiň, jestli je to rozbředlé.",
      "sourceSHA256": "b90584bea62fed77c4d956658e74d77cc33ed9124cfbd8208803b2b1192666f6",
      "translationSHA256": "cf79c41a69c6f27f19dff80f93f0c6c26912fb7a9d771e00b1f39851f4e5fb4f",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Do me a favor... when I pass away, use my dust to fertilize some corn for the hens.",
      "translation": "Udělej pro mě laskavost... až umřu, použij můj popel k pohnojení kukuřice pro slepice.",
      "sourceSHA256": "a4d48db5cb392aac20c8d8e8ab679660313fcc5ca756a454e90154e56c46e3a5",
      "translationSHA256": "333b4f9c9e10a9b220afb748cd89833d81eafa1ad6c9f0d28f11912b9a62f4dc",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "*smooch*... Mmm, it tastes like someone's been nibbling on pizza rolls.$6",
      "translation": "*pusa*... Mmm, chutná to, jako by tu někdo ujídal pizzové rolky.$6",
      "sourceSHA256": "67f5ad172b0b261176f63fb71e309696249361e2db323baea4acc5cdfe5cdde5",
      "translationSHA256": "4e07dd555d6252beb6c85cab19ea0564ca439b7f15e298b00601f34b25d19c85",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Indoor_Day_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I may keep to myself a lot, and I may seem unhappy sometimes... but I do appreciate all the work you do. I'm a lucky guy.$6",
      "translation": "Možná se hodně držím stranou a občas vypadám nešťastně... ale vážím si veškeré práce, kterou děláš. Mám vážně štěstí.$6",
      "sourceSHA256": "320645ce4a3786d4199bc88688f70bc6e3c8f3e936500fef9370c88723364db4",
      "translationSHA256": "9ad9c6e5e44e79b811865c368fcaa7826a93ecac9377dd060cd8f9db0d0c8e13",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_0",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'm just gonna have a couple more beers before closing my eyes for the night.",
      "translation": "Dám si ještě pár piv a pak už na noc zavřu oči.",
      "sourceSHA256": "90a74a3861ae0fbbb2c3fd882ba181222b8ba4e79d3b9f9eaab6c98467fbed33",
      "translationSHA256": "26e35ddb44289beb4f86ce6c1a1cbbdb81e2a9e9b1b22da4e4e9db5ea1fce8c5",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "If... If only... ah, I was just thinking back on the glory days, when I played gridball on the varsity team.$6#$b#Now I'm old and weak, though...",
      "translation": "Kdyby... kéž by... ach, jen jsem vzpomínal na časy své největší slávy, kdy jsem hrál gridball za školní reprezentaci.$6#$b#Teď jsem ale starý a slabý...",
      "sourceSHA256": "b3350156fc283d9c092df89c778944341be53936f1aae52165e35727d1db285d",
      "translationSHA256": "ea0de5ec83f0cad114316b14b0d36d351dd42b47a9f20ecda6ba0285418a813e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ughh... *gurgle*... I feel a little bloated... oof... too much Joja all-purpose dipping sauce.",
      "translation": "Uch... *kručení*... Jsem trochu nafouklý... uf... Příliš mnoho univerzální omáčky na namáčení od Joja.",
      "sourceSHA256": "27486fd82682424e53485efa7476f832177464c033a25d0c630847e0ece67f5f",
      "translationSHA256": "2323b47f7368f41f29771d27347f0c13287834371f1f65430171b578c54dbe81",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Buh... I wish I was six inches taller and a whole lot smarter...#$e#You like me for who I am? I still have a hard time understanding that...",
      "translation": "Blé... Kéž bych byl o šest palců vyšší a mnohem chytřejší...#$e#Líbím se ti takový, jaký jsem? Pořád to těžko chápu...",
      "sourceSHA256": "b3431489b988c78eb7c2bd8b0f72fd8add720cca0fc40e7e112a490bdb4ebe3e",
      "translationSHA256": "46c811b4908d3b41011c1b8dc16192ae9ca9e88dc4f244124a8adfec9c769a3c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Indoor_Night_4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I spent all day watching TV and now my legs feel like soft dough. Guess I'll have to take it easy until tomorrow.",
      "translation": "Celý den jsem sledoval televizi a teď mám nohy jako z měkkého těsta. Asi to budu muset do zítřka brát zlehka.",
      "sourceSHA256": "86c40ddae99334b3cd201699e13307bd0ff3d4feaf471db96d56284a62e344de",
      "translationSHA256": "54859c26840752c37db9c59bec870db3295f6500512dd3cca0c856672fbaa2e0",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Outdoor_0",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I didn't sleep well last night so I'm hoping this fresh air will get the juices flowing.#$e#What juices, you ask? Heh... you're weird.$h",
      "translation": "V noci jsem špatně spal, tak doufám, že mi čerstvý vzduch rozproudí šťávy.#$e#Jaké šťávy, ptáš se? Heh... ty máš ale divné otázky.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "88eb557f781e8d68b6cb416b700bbfca2af5fd9daeca25939a0b1f4deba572a9",
      "translationSHA256": "faf7641aaeda0eaf023b8bfd9d5c105f575bc12889ecc15c7985349bb8f950a8",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Outdoor_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Sometimes I stop and realize that I'm nothing more than a bag of juicy, squishy flesh.#$e#But hey... that's just fine... what's life, anyway?$h",
      "translation": "Někdy se zastavím a uvědomím si, že nejsem nic víc než pytel šťavnatého, měkkého masa.#$e#Ale hele... to je v pohodě... co vůbec znamená život?$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "da3e67691814cabd4dc8149ca0185246ed1b95b45336023238a6011de51f88f2",
      "translationSHA256": "a83ac9a2096433ca4f1811367ae43dbbee4bf52e246387961eeb87be698ee27e",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Outdoor_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "When I stop and think about it... I'm in a good place. My life is pretty nice.$6",
      "translation": "Když se zastavím a zamyslím... Jsem na dobrém místě. Vede se mi docela dobře.$6",
      "sourceSHA256": "472eb88631b2e6de19f3ab0523e2d4096bc21b5bdf31aa6d3437b28854d72449",
      "translationSHA256": "d42bd02fcf3635b86791009d8ccb132a3f2a8b4728567b38da0735bda4da9c4d",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueShane",
      "key": "Outdoor_3",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ooohh... my tongue is swollen from eating too many pepper poppers.$s",
      "translation": "Úúú... Po všech těch papričkových chuťovkách mám oteklý jazyk.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "52035ede379bcf4ef66be283018b2c0256782a5b08a39d83cd1c1ffd28c00c12",
      "translationSHA256": "31aa7f4667a1f54aa8aec6aff85f451bea839b6375880745ed694aea73081272",
